{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "PiCrawler \u2014 Trapezoid 0.085m (height sweep winner)",
    "description": "Stage C arm: trapezoidal height reward with target_height=0.085m. Winner of the n=20 paired-seed sweep (vs 0.10 baseline, 0.090, 0.095 variants at 200s/run). 0.085 ranked best on every stability metric measured: pct_upright 0.919, longest_upright_physics_ticks 6927, n_fall_events 11.9, n_tipover_events 0.0 (tied best at 200s) AND highest exploration (total_path_length 5.38m, max_distance_from_origin 1.54m).  Effect not statistically significant at 200s n=20 (paired-t p\u22481.0) because no condition produced enough tipovers to differentiate, but rank-ordering is consistent across 7 metrics.  Same A5 brain (IMU + joints EPMs + mc=1500 + linear-velocity stability) and same penalty schedule as Stage C-1 (grace=0.02m, scale=0.03, gain=0.05) \u2014 only target_height changes from 0.10 to 0.085.  Use this slot in the UI to verify the lower cap produces the expected stability-without-tipover behaviour the inverted-U arm was reaching for.",
    "env_target": "picrawler",
    "phase_tag": "v6.0.b.16 \u2014 Stage C trapezoid @ 0.085m (sweep winner)",
    "episode_length": 6000,
    "mc_episode_period": 1500,
    "stability_gain": 0.05,
    "stability_y_norm": 0.5,
    "stability_speed": 0.05,
    "reward_shape": "trapezoid",
    "target_height": 0.085,
    "height_penalty_grace": 0.02,
    "height_penalty_scale": 0.03,
    "height_penalty_gain": 0.05
  },
